{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22026","headline":"和荅诗十首 和松树 · 白居易","name":"和荅诗十首 和松树","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"亭亭山上松，一一生朝阳。\n森耸上参天，柯条百尺长。\n漠漠尘中槐，两两夹康庄。\n婆娑低覆地，枝干亦寻常。\n八月白露降，槐叶次第黄。\n岁暮满山雪，松色郁青苍。\n彼如君子心，秉操贯冰霜。\n此如小人面，变态随炎凉。\n共知松胜槐，诚欲栽道傍。\n粪土种瑶草，瑶草终不芳。\n尚可以斧斤，伐之爲栋梁。\n杀身获其所，爲君构明堂。\n不然终天年，老死在南冈。\n不愿亚枝叶，低随槐树行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}